  "description": "Core services, models, and abstractions for unified mobile application attestation. Provides a single, unified interface to verify device integrity across multiple providers, including Firebase App Check (Apple App Attest, Google Play Integrity) with Replay Protection, and Huawei Mobile Services (HMS) SafetyDetect via either UserDetect or SysIntegrity.",
